#. 記憶を失った瞬間…
#. それは、<CLT 3>あの時<CLT>以外には考えられない。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The moment I lost my memories... I can't think of any\n"
"time other than...<CLT 3>that day<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 最初に、玄関ホールにやって来て、
#. そこから廊下に足を踏み入れた直後…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When I first came to the gates of this school,\n"
"and stepped foot in the main hall..."
msgstr ""

#. あそこで妙な感覚に襲われて…
#. <CLT 3>気を失った時<CLT>…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>When I passed out<CLT>...I was overcome with a strange\n"
"sensation..."
msgstr ""

#. スゴーイ！　まだ答える元気があったんだね！
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Wow! You still have enough spirit to keep on talking,\n"
"huh?"
msgstr ""

#. うーんとねぇ…難しい事はわかんないんだけど、
#. みんなが気を失ったように感じたのって…
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Umm, so I don't know much about the details, but it\n"
"seems like everyone remembers passing out, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 記憶喪失によって引き起こされた、
#. 時間感覚の狂い…的な？
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And your sense of time got all messed up because of\n"
"the memory loss after that...?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、それっぽい事なんじゃない！？
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I guess it musta been something like that!"
msgstr ""

#. あの後、ボクが目を覚ましたのは、
#. 教室の机の上だった…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"After I passed out, I woke up in a classroom, with my\n"
"head on a desk..."
msgstr ""

#. あれは、玄関ホールで倒れた直後だとばかり、
#. 思ってたけど…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I assumed not much time had passed since I'd collapsed\n"
"in the main hall."
msgstr ""

#. あはは、直後どころか<CLT 3>２年後<CLT>だよ！
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahaha. But instead, <CLT 3>two whole years<CLT> had gone by!"
msgstr ""

#. それを直後だと感じていたのは…
#. その間の記憶が丸ごと抜け落ちていたせい…？
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The reason it felt so short was because...our memories\n"
"of the time in between had been completely removed?"
msgstr ""

#. ２年という月日の記憶がな！
#. つまり、オメェらはなぁ…
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You got it, honey! Two years of memories, poof, gone!\n"
"Which means, of course..."
msgstr ""

#. そう、初対面なんかではなかったのですよ。
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"When everyone met for the first time, it wasn't\n"
"actually for the first time."
msgstr ""

#. それにも関わらず、
#. あなた方は自己紹介なんてしていたようですけど…
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Unaware of this fact, you took the time to introduce\n"
"yourselves to each other. But..."
msgstr ""

#. あの時点で私達は…
#. すでに２年間を共に過ごしたクラスメイトだった…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But by that point, we'd already spent two years\n"
"together at the school."
msgstr ""

#. それが…あの写真の本当の意味…？
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's what those photos reveal, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…そういう事…
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... Yup! That's what they reveal!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、オマエラは２年間を共にした仲間同士で、
#. 殺し合ってたんだよ！
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You were all such close friends. You spent two years\n"
"together. And then you started killing each other!"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、滅びた外の世界なんかに出る為にね！
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And it was all so you could escape into a world that's\n"
"already been annihilated!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…酷い話だよね…
#. 今更、外に出ても仕方ないのにね…
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. What a terribly tragic tale... Even if you\n"
"left now, there's nothing you could do to fix it!"
msgstr ""

#. お前が…そうなるように仕向けたんだろ…！
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're the one who set things up to be like this!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 私はあなた達の事を愛しています…
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I love you all so much..."
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Cái gì?"

#. この学園生活が始まってから…
#. 私はあなた達の事ばかりを考えていました…
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Once your school life here began, I thought about you\n"
"constantly."
msgstr ""

#. 好きになって…当然じゃないですか…
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It's only natural that I would...fall in love."
msgstr ""

#. だから、大好きなみんなの為に教えてあげるね！
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So since I love you guys so much, I'll tell you all\n"
"about it!"
msgstr ""

#. わたし達“超高校級の絶望”が練り上げた、
#. <CLT 3>人類絶望化計画<CLT>について！
msgctxt "0028 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"All about the idea we came up with as the Ultimate\n"
"Despair—our <CLT 3>plan to bring despair to all mankind<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>超高校級の絶望の…人類絶望化計画…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The Ultimate Despair? All mankind...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 話は２年前にさかのぼっちゃいまーす。
msgctxt "0030 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Let's go back in time two years, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. ２年前…みんなが入学した時だね。
msgctxt "0031 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Back to when everyone first came to this school..."
msgstr ""

#. 最初の１年間は、
#. 平和と希望に満ちあふれた学園生活でしたー！
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"School life during that first year overflowed with\n"
"hope and happiness!"
msgstr ""

#. 普通で最低な学園生活でしたー！
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Oh boy, it was just the worst!"
msgstr ""

#. みんなはそれを満喫して…
#. ホント、青春してたんだよー！
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Everyone was enjoying themselves so much. You were all\n"
"having the time of your lives!"
msgstr ""

#. ですが、それも長くは続きませんでした。
#. 平和だったのは最初の１年だけ…
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But that couldn't last forever, of course. The\n"
"peacefulness only made it through that first year..."
msgstr ""

#. なぜなら、あなた方が入学した１年後に、
#. 人類を絶望に叩き込む事件が起きたからです。
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Because after that, an event unfolded that hammered a\n"
"soul-crushing despair into all of humanity."
msgstr ""

#. それが、<CLT 3>人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件<CLT>…
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The biggest, most awful, most tragic event in human\n"
"history... <CLT 3>The Tragedy<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そして、平和な日々は
#. あっけなく終わりを告げたのです。
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"All too soon, the world's days of peace came to a\n"
"bloody end."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、この学園も例外ではありません。
msgctxt "0039 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And as you can imagine, the school was no exception."
msgstr ""

#. 人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件の影響で、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園の生徒達は、ほぼ全滅したのです。
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The Tragedy even made its way here, leading to the\n"
"extermination of most of the students."
msgstr ""

#. 何者…なの？
msgctxt "0041 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What...are you?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…？　何がだい？
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hm? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件…
#. そんな事件を起こした超高校級の絶望…
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The most tragic event in human history, and the\n"
"\"Ultimate Despair\" that caused it..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたと戦刃むくろの２人だけとは考えられない。
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it's all because of just you and\n"
"Mukuro."
msgstr ""

#. それは組織なの？　集団なの？　家族なの？
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Was it some kind of organization? An angry mob? An\n"
"incredibly motivated family?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだね。答えるとすれば…
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "You have a point. If I had to describe it, I'd say..."
msgstr ""

#. どれでもないよ。
#. なんて言うか、もっと観念的なものなんだ。
msgctxt "0047 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It was none of those. How can I put it? It was more of\n"
"an ideological thing."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望は<CLT 3>伝染<CLT>するんだよ。
#. それは、現象の類とも似ているかもしれないね。
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Despair is contagious<CLT>, you know. It's almost\n"
"like...a natural phenomenon."
msgstr ""

#. 誰もが…絶望するんだよ…
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Everyone is capable of it."
msgstr ""

#. そして今や…
#. 滅びた世界のすべてが絶望…
msgctxt "0050 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And now, the entire world has fallen into despair."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、絶望を敵と見なすなら、
#. あなた達の敵は<CLT 3>“世界そのもの”<CLT>という事よ！
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"In other words, if you see despair as the enemy, then\n"
"your enemy...is <CLT 3>the world itself<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 意味が…わからないわ…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I just don't understand why..."
msgstr ""

#. わからせようと思って喋ってないのよ。
#. そもそも、本題からそれた話でしかないのだから！
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"We didn't ask you to try to understand. This was a\n"
"tangent anyway, unrelated to the matter at hand."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…話を元に戻しましょう…
msgctxt "0054 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Okay, so let's get back to the story..."
msgstr ""

#. 壊滅的なダメージを受けた希望ヶ峰学園…
#. そんな中で…あなた達だけが生き残りました…
msgctxt "0055 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Hope's Peak had taken so much damage. You guys were\n"
"the only survivors."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>希望ヶ峰学園第７８期生<CLT>の…あなた達だけ…
msgctxt "0056 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The members of <CLT 3>the 78th class of Hope's Peak Academy<CLT>\n"
"were the only ones left..."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたらね、そこで面白い事が起きたんだよ！
msgctxt "0057 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And then, something super neat happened!"
msgstr ""

#. よく聞いてね！
#. わたしは、大事な事は１回しか言わないからね！
msgctxt "0058 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Now pay attention, cuz this is important and I'm only\n"
"gonna say it once!"
msgstr ""

#. なんと！　生き残ったみんなを守る為に、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園の<CLT 3>シェルター化<CLT>が始まったのです！
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So guess what! To protect everyone who had survived,\n"
"Hope's Peak was transformed into a <CLT 3>shelter<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そう、希望ヶ峰学園の<CLT 3>シェルター化<CLT>が始まったのです！
msgctxt "0060 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That's right! It was transformed into a <CLT 3>shelter<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …はッ！　２回…ッ！！
msgctxt "0061 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahh! I said it twice!"
msgstr ""

#. では、そのシェルター化を行った<CLT 3>人物<CLT>…
#. つまり、あなた方をここに閉じ込めた<CLT 3>人物<CLT>…
msgctxt "0062 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Now, someone was <CLT 3>responsible<CLT> for that transformation,\n"
"for creating what would eventually become your prison."
msgstr ""

#. それが、どなたか…
#. あなた方はご存知ですか？
msgctxt "0063 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Do any of you know who that might have been?"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長
msgctxt "0064 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The headmaster"
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子
msgctxt "0065 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Junko"
msgstr ""

#. あなた方を守る為のシェルター化を
#. わざわざ、私様がするとでも！？
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Are you seriously suggesting that I would deliberately\n"
"create a shelter to *protect* you guys!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>シェルター化はボク達を守る為なら…
#. そんな事をするのは、あの人しか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's right. If it was for our protection, there's\n"
"only one person who would have done that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 首相
msgctxt "0069 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The prime minister"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、そんな話じゃないわ。
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Come on. This isn't that kind of story."
msgstr ""

#. あなたは…
#. その答えの手掛かりを見ているはずよ。
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You must have found at least one clue that can lead\n"
"you to the right answer."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手掛かりって、もしかして…
#. 見てる途中でモノクマに邪魔されたあれの事…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A clue? Maybe she means... I was watching something,\n"
"and then Monokuma came and interrupted me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…絶望過ぎて、
#. 答える元気もなくなった？
msgctxt "0074 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. Has despair stolen all your moxie? Your gusto?\n"
"Have you lost all desire to answer?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0075 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…絶望なんてしてない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I haven't despaired just yet...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園のシェルター化で、ボクらを守ろうとした人も、
#. きっと絶望なんてしてなかったはずだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And whoever built this shelter for us, they didn't\n"
"despair either!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望ヶ峰学園をシェルター化して、
#. ボクらをここに閉じ込めた人物って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The one who turned Hope's Peak into a shelter and\n"
"isolated us here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
